@startuml
title PolicyPal - Question Answering Sequence

skinparam shadowing false

actor Employee
participant "PolicyPal UI" as UI
participant "Chat API" as API
participant "Policy Retrieval" as Retrieval
participant "Claude API" as Claude

Employee -> UI : Ask question
UI -> API : Send question

API -> Retrieval : Find relevant policy
Retrieval --> API : Relevant sections

alt Sensitive / unsupported question

    API --> UI : Referral response
    UI --> Employee : Contact People & Culture

else Policy answer available

    API -> Claude : Question + policy context
    Claude --> API : Grounded answer

    API --> UI : Answer + citation
    UI --> Employee : Display answer

end

@enduml